> from .store_inmemory import InMemoryStore
> from .store_sqlalchemy import Base, SQLAlchemyMemoryStore
> ```
> 
> ---
> 
> ## Convenience data container
> 
> This is handy for integration tests.
> 
> ```python
> @dataclass
> class TestMemorySystem:
>     long_term_memory: LongTermMemory
>     store: object
>     model: MockMemoryModel
>     index: object
> ```
> 
> You could make these more strongly typed, but for test scaffolding, this is enough.
> 
> ---
> 
> ## Object factory helpers
